<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Bizzlo Pre-Departure Support Pack</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Bizzlo Pre-Departure Support Pack</h1>
  <h2>Before travel</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Confirm visa grant, passport, offer letter, fee receipt, accommodation, insurance, and flight details.</li>
    <li>Prepare university enrollment steps, arrival date, airport transfer, emergency contact, and local SIM plan.</li>
    <li>Check forex, international card, tuition balance, and living expense plan.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Accommodation and arrival</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Collect preference for campus housing, private halls, shared flats, budget, and move-in date.</li>
    <li>Track airport pickup, city transfer, check-in document, tenancy terms, and deposit receipt.</li>
    <li>Record support request status in Bizzlo so the partner and Videshway team can follow up.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>First week checklist</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>University enrollment, ID card, bank account, local phone number, health registration, and class timetable.</li>
    <li>Partner counselor checks student arrival confirmation and closes the support request after completion.</li>
  </ul>
</body>
</html>
